Use R-4.3 and the testing version, and it should all be there.

If you run into 'GLIBC_2.29' not found', try installing another binary,
with

inla.binary.install()

try one, if it does not work, try another one.

pardiso.license argument is no longer there as the authors, via
panua.ch <http://panua.ch>, has changed the way its working. place 'panua.lic' in the home
directory, and thats it

