it should be fixed now, there there are still NAN issues its caused by
other reasons, likely.

if there are problems, please share an an example I can rerun.

the issues with

("OMP: Info #268: OMP_NESTED
variable deprecated, please use OMP_MAX_ACTIVE_LEVELS instead.").

are coming from the libgomp library, and the inla-code is fixed, but the
warnings are triggered by the 'OMP_NESTED' or related calls, in other
libraries not under our control.

 I filer some of those away, so the most recent testing version shoul be
better.

